(A) by the CfD Counterparty to the Generator if there are QCiL Net Capital Costs; or
(B) by the Generator to the CfD Counterparty where there are QCiL Net Capital Savings , irrespective of whether or not the relevant Qualifying Change in Law occurs, is implemented or becomes effective before, on or after the Start Date.
